# {project_name}

A minimal Ajolopy project scaffolded by `ajolopy new`.

## Quickstart

```bash
uv sync
cp .env.example .env  # then fill in {llm_env_var}
ajolopy dev
```

## Layout

- `src/{package_name}/main.py` — ASGI entry point.
- `src/{package_name}/app_module.py` — `@Module` root wiring.
- `src/{package_name}/agents/` — `@Agent` / `@Workflow` classes.
- `tests/` — pytest suite.
- `evals/` — optional `@Eval` suites + JSONL datasets.

## Useful commands

| Task | Command |
| ---- | ------- |
| Install deps | `uv sync` |
| Run the app | `ajolopy dev` |
| Run tests | `uv run pytest` |
| Run evals | `ajolopy eval` |
